# WebShop server requirement allowlist: the packages upstream's web_agent_site imports
# (pinned to upstream requirements.txt's versions, Werkzeug < 3 and pydantic < 2 per
# upstream issues #28, #52, #53), never upstream's requirements.txt itself (it lists the
# unrelated PyPI packages env and train and unpinned gradio and gdown). No
# python-Levenshtein: thefuzz runs on difflib. en_core_web_sm 3.3.0 is upstream goal.py's
# model. requirements.txt is this file resolved with hashes for cp39 manylinux x86_64:
#   uv pip compile requirements.in --python-version 3.9 \
#     --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_31 --generate-hashes --emit-index-url \
#     --index-url https://pypi.org/simple \
#     --extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu \
#     --index-strategy unsafe-best-match --no-header -o requirements.txt
